    "detailed_description": "<h1>Join Us</h1><p><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2223420/extras/a22f0e569d87f26aec8d47141e150a81.avif?t=1754471419\" /></div><br>Join our Discord to tell us your thoughts, report game issues, and stay updated with the latest news about Voice of Belldona!</p><br><h1>Recommended for you</h1><p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1>Endless chaos reverberates throughout a world where the only constant is war.<br><br>In an effort to overcome the turmoil, the people decide to create a super-loli. But this white-haired, god-like entity has\u2026 a major case of social anxiety?!<br><br>She turns the once apocalyptic, barren world into a new one filled with races and civilizations previously known only from mythology and fairy tales, and grants the mysterious power of The Source to its inhabitants, including humans.<br><br>Voice of Belldona takes place in this fantastic world created by Cheryl and tells the story of her adventures after being unexpectedly awakened again.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2223420/extras/931c187ae320ce76b378e53265fff498.poster.avif?t=1754471419\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2223420/extras/931c187ae320ce76b378e53265fff498.webm?t=1754471419\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2223420/extras/931c187ae320ce76b378e53265fff498.mp4?t=1754471419\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2223420/extras/64298acd8be5e22d7cad63eda8c485ed.avif?t=1754471419\" /></div><br><br>Play as the powerful Sourcerer Griza or the mighty Warrior Rinna. <br><br>Embark on an adventure, collecting resources, buffs, armies, weapons, and deadly skill cards, through a series of unique narrative missions. Two characters. Two completely different combat systems. Gorgeously rendered ultimate skill animations.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2223420/extras/9e009fdce17a83d4816757e3bcd7e233.poster.avif?t=1754471419\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2223420/extras/9e009fdce17a83d4816757e3bcd7e233.webm?t=1754471419\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2223420/extras/9e009fdce17a83d4816757e3bcd7e233.mp4?t=1754471419\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2223420/extras/68e1399f77939255b28573b7effaa1dc.poster.avif?t=1754471419\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2223420/extras/68e1399f77939255b28573b7effaa1dc.webm?t=1754471419\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2223420/extras/68e1399f77939255b28573b7effaa1dc.mp4?t=1754471419\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2223420/extras/9340d2e0412c4c00b03756c6ecc560c4.avif?t=1754471419\" /></div><br><br>Create a powerful character uniquely yours, using preset decks with different playing styles as well as the cards and buffs you collect during your adventures.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2223420/extras/5961620794aaedb88ccfc218de63957a.poster.avif?t=1754471419\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2223420/extras/5961620794aaedb88ccfc218de63957a.webm?t=1754471419\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2223420/extras/5961620794aaedb88ccfc218de63957a.mp4?t=1754471419\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br>{STEAM_APP_IMAGE}/extras/Powerful_Enemies.png<br><br>Be prepared. Your enemies will be strong... very strong.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2223420/extras/df2301fd3b1d85c2dd45229f2db75a84.poster.avif?t=1754471419\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2223420/extras/df2301fd3b1d85c2dd45229f2db75a84.webm?t=1754471419\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2223420/extras/df2301fd3b1d85c2dd45229f2db75a84.mp4?t=1754471419\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2223420/extras/addbeb1852d856ddd55bba4b4b6137bb.avif?t=1754471419\" /></div><br><br>Mechanical raptors. Pegasus cavalry. Flesh-tearing Harpies. Gain air superiority with amazing flying units never before seen in a roguelike card game.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2223420/extras/71994a41de748160536f7fb135133ff1.poster.avif?t=1754471419\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2223420/extras/71994a41de748160536f7fb135133ff1.webm?t=1754471419\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2223420/extras/71994a41de748160536f7fb135133ff1.mp4?t=1754471419\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br>Deploy powerful aerial units to dominate the skies and disrupt enemy lines.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2223420/extras/4639c47e016abbe923246a2d27d3b94c.poster.avif?t=1754471419\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2223420/extras/4639c47e016abbe923246a2d27d3b94c.webm?t=1754471419\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2223420/extras/4639c47e016abbe923246a2d27d3b94c.mp4?t=1754471419\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2223420/extras/ddd26af8ba61088348a07e3e2cacaebc.avif?t=1754471419\" /></div><br><br>Encounter an enigmatic non-human redhead, a critically wounded imperial officer, a lizard nun\u2014yes, you read that right!\u2014, a mysterious goblin collector who never reveals his face... and many more. In Voice of Belldona, weave your own story interacting with unforgettable characters you meet along the way.",
    "about_the_game": "Endless chaos reverberates throughout a world where the only constant is war.<br><br>In an effort to overcome the turmoil, the people decide to create a super-loli. But this white-haired, god-like entity has\u2026 a major case of social anxiety?!<br><br>She turns the once apocalyptic, barren world into a new one filled with races and civilizations previously known only from mythology and fairy tales, and grants the mysterious power of The Source to its inhabitants, including humans.<br><br>Voice of Belldona takes place in this fantastic world created by Cheryl and tells the story of her adventures after being unexpectedly awakened again.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2223420/extras/931c187ae320ce76b378e53265fff498.poster.avif?t=1754471419\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2223420/extras/931c187ae320ce76b378e53265fff498.webm?t=1754471419\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2223420/extras/931c187ae320ce76b378e53265fff498.mp4?t=1754471419\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2223420/extras/64298acd8be5e22d7cad63eda8c485ed.avif?t=1754471419\" /></div><br><br>Play as the powerful Sourcerer Griza or the mighty Warrior Rinna. <br><br>Embark on an adventure, collecting resources, buffs, armies, weapons, and deadly skill cards, through a series of unique narrative missions. Two characters. Two completely different combat systems. Gorgeously rendered ultimate skill animations.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2223420/extras/9e009fdce17a83d4